Confirmado: el único error del ítem es un acceso indexado repetido que `noUncheckedIndexedAccess` no puede volver a angostar tras la comprobación previa. Propongo capturar la entrada en una variable local para que TS conserve el angostamiento.

```json
{"file": "src/packages/command-runtime/src/skills/bundled/keybindings.ts",
 "edits": [{"old": "        if (!actionInfo[action as string]) {
          actionInfo[action as string] = { keys: [], context: block.context }
        }
        actionInfo[action as string].keys.push(key)", "new": "        const actionKey = action as string
        let entry = actionInfo[actionKey]
        if (!entry) {
          entry = { keys: [], context: block.context }
          actionInfo[actionKey] = entry
        }
        entry.keys.push(key)"}],
